WEBVTT

00:14:59.519 --> 00:15:02.814
who can read Mary Shelley's novel
in the right way,

00:15:02.814 --> 00:15:05.067
as a flare flung across time,

00:15:05.067 --> 00:15:09.071
because we too could create
an alternative intelligence,

00:15:09.071 --> 00:15:13.158
not out of the body parts
from the graveyard using electricity,

00:15:13.158 --> 00:15:15.869
but out of zeros and ones of code.

00:15:15.911 --> 00:15:19.247
And how is this going to end?
Utopia or dystopia?

00:15:19.289 --> 00:15:21.124
It's up to us.

00:15:21.166 --> 00:15:23.377
Endings are not set in stone.

00:15:24.252 --> 00:15:28.298
We change the story
because we are the story.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:32.302
Now, Marvin Minsky
called alternative intelligence